-- set to buffer slot 1 (a buffer voice), each started with toggle_voice.
-- test/unit/engine_sync_test.lua compares a start in this build with them
-- (the groundwork before 3.8: a start sends 3.7.0's messages).
--
-- How it was recorded (2026-11-17), as test/fixtures/3.6.0-start-calls.lua
-- was: a temporary detached worktree of the tag v3.7.0 (`git worktree add
-- --detach <scratch>/v370 v3.7.0`), a throwaway unit file there that seeds
-- math.randomseed(37), runs h.load_strata() and h.finish_startup(context),
-- stops the voices the start-up started (1 and 2), sets v3_source to 2
-- (buffer 1), and for each start clears context.engine_calls, calls
-- toggle_voice and writes each call as `name(args)`, numbers with "%.9g" and
-- strings with "%q"; run with `lua test/run.lua <its filter>` (Lua 5.3.6),
-- and the worktree then removed with `git worktree remove`. The run of
-- setVoiceParam calls after the two the hooks send (attackTime and
-- releaseTime) is the synth params in a pairs() order, which changes between
